# Atlas Global Cluster connection string. Copy from Atlas → Connect → Drivers
# and substitute the password for the pocuser database user.
#
# This MUST be a Global Cluster with three zones named US / EU / APAC, mapped
# respectively to AWS us-east-1, eu-central-1, and ap-southeast-1. The driver
# routes reads / writes to the correct zone based on the shard-key value.
MONGODB_URI=
